Purpose\
This FSD translates the agreed BRD into clear behaviour, screens, rules, and acceptance tests. It describes what the product must do, not how to build it.\
\
Scope\
This FSD covers: Build, Push, Learn, Track, Certified, Admin & Governance, Data & Privacy, Integrations, and Non\uc0\u8209 functional needs. The service offer (first upload + monthly refresh day) is delivered outside the app and is not part of this FSD.\
