\
6.2 Organisation set\uc0\u8209 up\
- Invite links at launch. Single sign\uc0\u8209 on can be added later based on client demand.\
- Teams and groups created in Cerply. Directory sync can be added later; marketing may state we can accommodate.\
- Company Admin can set: **allowed industry sources and domains**, blocked terms, and filter lists for the agent.\
- Record who did what and when for: **approvals**, locks, pushes, wraps, stamps, exports, takedowns, and setting changes.\
\
Acceptance tests (Admin)\
- Rights are enforced per role across Build, Push, Learn, Track, and Certified.\
- Audit log entries are created for all key actions named above.\
