7) Data, events, and privacy\
------------------------------------\
\
- **Cerply Building Blocks store:** structure templates, patterns, and logs (non\uc0\u8209 personal; no domain facts).\
- Client private store: client content and learner data. Hard wall between clients.\
- **Storage routing:** content from client uploads/prompts is stored in the client private store; Certified Core and Industry source content are referenced with citations; Cerply templates are meta\uc0\u8209 instructions only.\
- Item id, module id, skill tags, result (correct/incorrect/partial), answer time, hint use, time of day, confidence (if asked), channel (Slack/Teams/Web), **provenance of the item (origin badge)**.\
- 
