\f2\b model labels used
\f1\b0  (for generation and quality check), 
\f2\b provenance classification
\f1\b0  (Internal / Certified Core / Industry source / Cerply templates), and a reference to storage location (client/private vs reference). \
- 
\f2\b Model logs:
\f1\b0  model label, time, tokens, and estimated cost per generation and per quality check (no personal data).
