\
7.4 Retention\
- Keep versions forever with roll back. If asked to delete a person\'92s data, we delete personal data and keep anonymous patterns/aggregates for long\uc0\u8209 term optimisation.\
\
7.5 Regions\
- Data region by client (for example, UK or EU) as set by Company Admin at set\uc0\u8209 up.\
\
Acceptance tests (Data)\
- Exported PDF shows correct version lineage.\
- Deleting a learner removes personal data while leaving anonymous aggregates.\
