8) Integrations\
------------------------------------\
- Slack and Teams message delivery and replies.\
- Web app for browsers.\
- File uploads for Word, PowerPoint, PDF, Excel, text, CSV.\
- Email digests for managers (optional).\
\
Acceptance tests (Integrations)\
