------------------------------------\
9) Non\uc0\u8209 functional needs (from BRD)\
------------------------------------\
- Fast: normal page actions under one second.\
- Reliable: service up at least 99.9% each month.\
- Scalable: handle thousands of learners per client.\
- Accessible: modern web accessibility rules.\
- Simple: works on desktop and mobile browsers.\
- Intelligent: Interactions should never feel templated or deterministic.\
\
------------------------------------\
10) Error states and empty states\
------------------------------------\
- Build: if the agent cannot reach a source, show a clear message and continue with available sources; provide \'93retry\'94 and \'93remove source\'94.\
- Push: if an audience has no active users, warn before sending.\
- Learn: if a learner is at the daily cap, say \'93You\'92ve done today\'92s set. Continue?\'94 with a Continue button.\
- Certified: if a stamp is rejected, show reasons and suggested fixes.\
\
