11) Copy and tone (examples)\
------------------------------------\
- Nudge: \'932\uc0\u8209 minute check\u8209 in ready. Fancy a quick win?\'94\
- Help reply: \'93Here\'92s a short hint. Want a recap instead?\'94\
- Progress card: \'93Level 5 (Intermediate) \'95 Streak 3 \'95 Next due Thu 09:00 \'97 Continue | Review weak area\'94\
- Challenge receipt: \'93Thanks \'97 we\'92ve flagged this for review. You can carry on.\'94\
